   "description": "The Pilbara Series is inspired by one of Australia’s most rugged and remote landscapes. Whether you’re exploring reefs, trails, or just the daily grind, the Pilbara is ready for adventure. Specifications 316 Stainless Steel Case Polished ceramic bezel insert Miyota 9015 Automatic Movement (no batteries), with date window at 6 o'clock 200m Water Resistance Screw-down crown with luminous logo Swiss BGW9 luminous blocks and hands (Swiss Super LumiNova) Sapphire Crystal with anti-reflective treatment to underside Solid Stainless Steel Bracelet with quick release spring bars On-the-fly quick adjust clasp Included extras: FKM Rubber strap with SS end links, maroon 4-watch travel roll Dimensions 41mm case width 41.5mm Bezel width 11.8mm thickness (case + sapphire glass) 49mm lug-to-lug / case length 22mm lug width / strap width SS strap endlinks accept 20mm strap Bracelet is 22 to 20mm taper Own the adventure! Preorder Policy Note: Sample watches displayed Production Changes: There will be 1 visible production change; the bezel insert will be 0.4mm thicker, stretching toward the sapphire crystal - which will make the silver ring around the sapphire slightly narrower.",
