   "priceMinor": 66600,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Inspired by the red earth of Western Australia's outback, the Pilbara dive watch is a tough, high spec, wristwatch designed in Australia. Rugged enough for an Australian outback adventure, or diving Ningaloo, refined enough for any boardroom. The Pilbara is a well-proportioned comfortable watch that punches above its weight on all fronts. Limited to 50 pieces, these are now in stock and now shipping. Own the adventure! Rock Dial Red rock dial, made from special compressed rock material- each dial is unique. Inspired by the rocky outcrops throughout the Pilbara region, the color is representative of where the red dirt of the Pilbara mixes with the white sands of the Indian Ocean. In this variant only the dial text is printed on underside of sapphire, rather than on the dial. This creates a 'floating' effect, where the watch hands can pass underneath the text, and in certain lighting can cast a light shadow across the dial - an interesting, and sometimes captivating, effect. Assembled in Australia.",
